    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69748" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναρθηκο-φόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying a wand of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρθηξ</span>, like the
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχαι</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρσοφόρος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1107f
			</span></i>; of Dionysus, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				42.1
			</span></i>; prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοί τοι ν., παῦροι δέ τε
				Βάκχοι</span>, i.e. there are many officials, but few
			inspired, <i><span class="en">
				Zen.
				5.77
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				69c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rod-bearer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				2.3.18
			</span></i>.</div>
